["text"] = "You loot 60 Gold, 71 Silver, 73 Copper",
["id"] = "s51_3228",
["timestamp"] = 1785175528,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "N'Zoth the Corruptor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.9215686917304993,
["g"] = 0.7098039388656616,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "N'Zoth the Corruptor whispers: You tread within a vision of what was... and what will be.",
["id"] = "s51_3229",
["timestamp"] = 1785175529,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "N'Zoth the Corruptor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.9215686917304993,
["g"] = 0.7098039388656616,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "N'Zoth the Corruptor whispers: My empire is this world's inevitable destiny.",
["id"] = "s51_3230",
["timestamp"] = 1785175540,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Occult Shadowmender",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Occult Shadowmender says: Our slumber is over!",
["id"] = "s51_3231",
["timestamp"] = 1785175545,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Monstrous Behemoth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Monstrous Behemoth:288:MONSTER_SAY:|h[Monstrous Behemoth]|h says: [Shath'Yar] Yrr Bo'al Uhnish iiqaath!",
["id"] = "s51_3232",
["timestamp"] = 1785175545,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Maddened Conscript",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Maddened Conscript says: Kneel before your new masters!",
["id"] = "s51_3233",
["timestamp"] = 1785175545,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "MOTHER",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "MOTHER says: Signal interference negated. Connection restored.",
["id"] = "s51_3234",
["timestamp"] = 1785175549,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magni Bronzebeard",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magni Bronzebeard says: Yer back! What happened?",
["id"] = "s51_3235",
["timestamp"] = 1785175556,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: I learned that it doesn't take much for my friends to believe I betrayed them.",
["id"] = "s51_3236",
["timestamp"] = 1785175559,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: Champions, that vision was as much for me as it was for you. N'Zoth wants us to believe that my corruption is inevitable.",
["id"] = "s51_3237",
["timestamp"] = 1785175564,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: Doubt me if you must, but know that I will not rest until his smoldering corpse lies at my feet.",
["id"] = "s51_3238",
["timestamp"] = 1785175572,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "N'Zoth the Corruptor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.9215686917304993,
["g"] = 0.7098039388656616,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "N'Zoth the Corruptor whispers: Watch as my empire consumes your reality. Soon, all will be one.",
["id"] = "s51_3239",
["timestamp"] = 1785175573,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
