["text"] = "You loot 61 Gold, 11 Silver, 54 Copper",
["id"] = "s51_3346",
["timestamp"] = 1785176391,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: We fulfilled our end of the bargain, Azshara. Now honor yours.",
["id"] = "s51_3347",
["timestamp"] = 1785176397,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Azshara",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Azshara yells: Release me! Only I possess the means of defeating N'Zoth!",
["id"] = "s51_3348",
["timestamp"] = 1785176400,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Azshara",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Azshara says: Mind your tone, whelpling. A queen keeps her promises. Listen closely, as I will only say this once.",
["id"] = "s51_3349",
["timestamp"] = 1785176401,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Azshara",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Azshara says: For all his bluster, N'Zoth was ever the weakest of his kin. One vestige of their power yet remains that can be turned against him.",
["id"] = "s51_3350",
["timestamp"] = 1785176411,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Azshara",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Azshara says: I would have driven this blade into his foul heart myself... had you not disrupted my plans.",
["id"] = "s51_3351",
["timestamp"] = 1785176423,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Azshara",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Azshara says: No matter. Xal'atath is yours, mortals. Strike true. Should your first blow fail, you will not survive to attempt another.",
["id"] = "s51_3352",
["timestamp"] = 1785176431,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vexiona",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vexiona yells: Gather, servants of the Void. It is time to receive my gift.",
["id"] = "s51_3353",
["timestamp"] = 1785176435,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Azshara",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Azshara says: Now go and do what you will. I tire of intermediaries and heralds. The true throne of power beckons, and I intend to claim it.",
["id"] = "s51_3354",
["timestamp"] = 1785176443,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vexiona",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vexiona yells: Those who are worthy shall be remade through its power!",
["id"] = "s51_3355",
["timestamp"] = 1785176445,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "MOTHER",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "MOTHER says: New anchor point detected.",
["id"] = "s51_3356",
["timestamp"] = 1785176449,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Spellbound Ritualist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Spellbound Ritualist yells: Grant me your power!",
["id"] = "s51_3357",
["timestamp"] = 1785176452,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "MOTHER",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "MOTHER says: Recommendation: Terminate Void disruption.",
["id"] = "s51_3358",
["timestamp"] = 1785176453,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Stormclout-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: Azshara has a fondness for games. I will examine this dagger for signs of treachery. But for now, let us continue.",
["id"] = "s51_3359",
["timestamp"] = 1785176455,
},
{
