["text"] = "Renzik \"The Shiv\" says: Hey, you remember that suspicious wall down in the Ringing Deeps? Someone just blasted it to pieces.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200128,
["id"] = "s51_4085",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = -0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ3:|T134939:12|t|Hitem:111921::::::::90:258::14::1:28:960:::::|h[Draenor Engineering]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1785200194,
["id"] = "s51_4086",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_SKILL",
["type"] = "SKILL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.3333333432674408,
["g"] = 0.3333333432674408,
["b"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "You have gained the Draenor Engineering skill.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200207,
["id"] = "s51_4087",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leah Kranz",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Leah Kranz says: Fresh bread! Fresh bread for sale!",
["timestamp"] = 1785200208,
["id"] = "s51_4088",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Yrel",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Yrel says: Prophet, this hero - and many others from another world - have come to aid us.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200297,
["id"] = "s51_4089",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Prophet Velen",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Prophet Velen says: It is good to see you, my child. My people welcome your aid, champion. Come with me.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200302,
["id"] = "s51_4090",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vindicator Maraad",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Vindicator Maraad says: Plant your banner, and claim your destiny.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200310,
["id"] = "s51_4091",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Archmage Khadgar",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Archmage Khadgar says: I can open up a portal to Stormwind only briefly.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200316,
["id"] = "s51_4092",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Prophet Velen",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Prophet Velen says: I do hope my trust in your people is not misplaced.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200320,
["id"] = "s51_4093",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vindicator Maraad",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Vindicator Maraad says: I assure you, my Prophet, the commander we've chosen represents the very best of the Alliance.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200325,
["id"] = "s51_4094",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Foreman Zipfizzle",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Foreman Zipfizzle says: Alright, come on through. Steady... Steady...",
["timestamp"] = 1785200331,
["id"] = "s51_4095",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Baros Alexston",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Baros Alexston says: This is it, boys! Let's break some ground and take this world for the Alliance!",
["timestamp"] = 1785200336,
["id"] = "s51_4096",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = -0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T924155:12|t|Hitem:108918::::::::90:258::11:1:13617:2:9:90:28:63:::::|h[Karabor Arcanist Rod (Two-Hand 40)]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1785200354,
["id"] = "s51_4097",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Baros Alexston",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Baros Alexston says: If you mark those trees, Shelly's lumberjacks will do the rest.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200355,
["id"] = "s51_4098",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Baros Alexston",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Baros Alexston says: Giant killer ravens... I have a feeling it's going to be a long, cold night.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200356,
["id"] = "s51_4099",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Baros Alexston",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Baros Alexston says: An excellent choice of lumber, if I do say so myself.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200454,
["id"] = "s51_4100",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Baros Alexston",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Baros Alexston says: Impressive work, commander. I know I'll sleep a lot better without those giant killer birds flying around.",
["timestamp"] = 1785200454,
["id"] = "s51_4101",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
