["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "The nearby guard glares at you and the void energy that you surround yourself with.",
["id"] = "s51_4195",
["timestamp"] = 1785258792,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Elder Hagar has called on the elven leaders to join this gathering in Harandar. It is of great importance.",
["id"] = "s51_4196",
["timestamp"] = 1785258937,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lor'themar Theron",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lor'themar Theron says: It would be an honor. We will join you as soon as we can.",
["id"] = "s51_4197",
["timestamp"] = 1785258945,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Orc",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Steeww",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Steeww-Tichondrius:155:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddSteeww|r]|h: and yeah 3 loses in a row i went from 2360 to 2000",
["id"] = "s51_4198",
["timestamp"] = 1785259038,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Orc",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Steeww",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Steeww-Tichondrius:158:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddSteeww|r]|h: by bad 2330",
["id"] = "s51_4199",
["timestamp"] = 1785259085,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Orc",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Steeww",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Steeww-Tichondrius:159:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddSteeww|r]|h: to 2000",
["id"] = "s51_4200",
["timestamp"] = 1785259091,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Den Welcomer",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Den Welcomer says: Good, you are here. The elders and others await you below.",
["id"] = "s51_4201",
["timestamp"] = 1785259123,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Den Welcomer",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Den Welcomer says: Good, you are here. The elders and others await you below.",
["id"] = "s51_4202",
["timestamp"] = 1785259126,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: All manner of elves and trolls are here. We await only the blood elves and the Amani.",
["id"] = "s51_4203",
["timestamp"] = 1785259133,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: So many old wounds. It makes them tense, being near those who were enemies for so long.",
["id"] = "s51_4204",
["timestamp"] = 1785259137,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: For a group that has avoided trolls and elves for so long, the haranir seem rather rushed to tell us something.",
["id"] = "s51_4205",
["timestamp"] = 1785259143,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "First Arcanist Thalyssra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "First Arcanist Thalyssra says: Many kaldorei still view us with scorn. To them, we are either cowards who hid from the Legion or traitors who joined the Horde.",
["id"] = "s51_4206",
["timestamp"] = 1785259147,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Talanji",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Talanji says: All of Azeroth respects de haranir for fighting against de Void. But to bring so many old enemies to one place? Watch carefully.",
["id"] = "s51_4207",
["timestamp"] = 1785259154,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["class"] = "DEMONHUNTER",
["name"] = "Shanxrift",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Shanxrift-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Shanxrift|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61635:Player-11-0EB9F647:1:7:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Voidspire: Weapons of the Void]|h|r!",
["id"] = "s51_4208",
["timestamp"] = 1785259214,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rokhan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Rokhan says: De Darkspear spilled blood with some of de trolls and elves here. But I be willing to set aside old rivalries for de common good.",
["id"] = "s51_4209",
["timestamp"] = 1785259218,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Shandris Feathermoon",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Shandris Feathermoon says: The kaldorei will do what we must for the preservation of this world... and the protection of our people.",
["id"] = "s51_4210",
["timestamp"] = 1785259221,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vereesa Windrunner",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vereesa Windrunner says: I am told the Amani have been invited as well. Do not expect me to break bread with those murderers.",
["id"] = "s51_4211",
["timestamp"] = 1785259227,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Orc",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Steeww",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Steeww-Tichondrius:180:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddSteeww|r]|h: gratz",
["id"] = "s51_4212",
["timestamp"] = 1785259230,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Neonvoid? How nice to see another familiar face here!",
["id"] = "s51_4213",
["timestamp"] = 1785259233,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = -0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7386623:12|t|Hitem:246731::::::::90:258::11::1:28:872:::::|h[Dusk Grimlynx]|h|r",
["id"] = "s51_4214",
["timestamp"] = 1785259238,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: It's good to have you along, Neonvoid. Now where is my nephew?",
["id"] = "s51_4215",
["timestamp"] = 1785259241,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lor'themar Theron",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lor'themar Theron says: We share a lineage with the trolls? With the Amani? This... this is preposterous!",
["id"] = "s51_4216",
["timestamp"] = 1785259247,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: These are shocking revelations. But I have fought beside them, Lor'themar. We share more in common than you may think.",
["id"] = "s51_4217",
["timestamp"] = 1785259253,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Queen Talanji",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Queen Talanji says: I will have to tell the other tribes. They will not be pleased.",
["id"] = "s51_4218",
["timestamp"] = 1785259255,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Proof? What do you mean proof?",
["id"] = "s51_4219",
["timestamp"] = 1785259261,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: The defenders of the Vale are growing weary. Use this rejuvenation pollen to revive them.",
["id"] = "s51_4220",
["timestamp"] = 1785259261,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Orweyna. How do you know Hagar speaks the truth?",
["id"] = "s51_4221",
["timestamp"] = 1785259264,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: We must go to the Den of Echoes. Follow me.",
["id"] = "s51_4222",
["timestamp"] = 1785259268,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.",
["id"] = "s51_4223",
["timestamp"] = 1785259278,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Dracthyr",
["class"] = "EVOKER",
["name"] = "Zendrozat-Illidan",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Zendrozat-Illidan|h[|cff33937fZendrozat-Illidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:648:Player-57-0E2C01D6:1:7:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Blood Furnace]|h|r!",
["id"] = "s51_4224",
["timestamp"] = 1785259289,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: The proof lies in one of the paintings within.",
["id"] = "s51_4225",
["timestamp"] = 1785259291,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Bah! You expect me to believe some scratches on a wall?",
["id"] = "s51_4226",
["timestamp"] = 1785259299,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Give me your hand. Touch the visionstone and bear witness.",
["id"] = "s51_4227",
["timestamp"] = 1785259303,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Our magic only works for memories of our kin. How can we find paintings of Amani memories if you are not kin?",
["id"] = "s51_4228",
["timestamp"] = 1785259305,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Dis land looks familiar... dis is Zul'Aman!",
["id"] = "s51_4229",
["timestamp"] = 1785259307,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Yes. A desperate battle long ago, between the Amani and ancient enemies.",
["id"] = "s51_4230",
["timestamp"] = 1785259316,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Injured Amani Warrior",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Injured Amani Warrior says: We can't hold out much longer!",
["id"] = "s51_4231",
["timestamp"] = 1785259334,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Injured Amani Warrior",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Injured Amani Warrior says: De Amani never die!",
["id"] = "s51_4232",
["timestamp"] = 1785259344,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = -0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T6012072:12|t|Hitem:260671::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Oversized Gland]|h|rx2",
["id"] = "s51_4233",
["timestamp"] = 1785259365,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Injured Amani Warrior",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Injured Amani Warrior says: Victory at any cost!",
["id"] = "s51_4234",
["timestamp"] = 1785259375,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: I know dis battle! Dis is our great victory I heard stories of when I was a child!",
["id"] = "s51_4235",
["timestamp"] = 1785259380,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Injured Amani Warrior",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Injured Amani Warrior says: I get back in de fight!",
["id"] = "s51_4236",
["timestamp"] = 1785259381,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Injured Amani Warrior",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Injured Amani Warrior says: We have to push forward!",
["id"] = "s51_4237",
["timestamp"] = 1785259389,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: We Amani stood alone, no gokinye, no loa, and we defeated de greatest enemy de trolls had ever known.",
["id"] = "s51_4238",
["timestamp"] = 1785259389,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: The trolls would have lost but a few took a desperate risk.",
["id"] = "s51_4239",
["timestamp"] = 1785259438,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = -0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T6012072:12|t|Hitem:260671::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Oversized Gland]|h|r",
["id"] = "s51_4240",
["timestamp"] = 1785259439,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: They sought the most powerful presence they could find... and pulled.",
["id"] = "s51_4241",
["timestamp"] = 1785259449,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: And summoned a creature from a place none should disturb: the Rift of Aln.",
["id"] = "s51_4242",
["timestamp"] = 1785259455,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: The Rift of Aln is a place of madness and pain, but the Amani found something greater.",
["id"] = "s51_4243",
["timestamp"] = 1785259464,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: They called it...",
["id"] = "s51_4244",
["timestamp"] = 1785259472,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Ula'tek.",
["id"] = "s51_4245",
["timestamp"] = 1785259476,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Amani Summoner",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Amani Summoner says: Ula'tek! Ula'tek! Ula'tek!",
["id"] = "s51_4246",
["timestamp"] = 1785259478,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Amani Summoner",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Amani Summoner says: Ula'tek! Ula'tek! Ula'tek!",
["id"] = "s51_4247",
["timestamp"] = 1785259478,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Amani Summoner",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Amani Summoner says: Ula'tek! Ula'tek! Ula'tek!",
["id"] = "s51_4248",
["timestamp"] = 1785259478,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Fabled Priestess",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Fabled Priestess says: Ula'tek! Ula'tek! Ula'tek!",
["id"] = "s51_4249",
["timestamp"] = 1785259478,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: No! This must be lies! De Amani alone won this victory!",
["id"] = "s51_4250",
["timestamp"] = 1785259492,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: We will discover de truth of this, gokinye.",
["id"] = "s51_4251",
["timestamp"] = 1785259571,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: What he means to say is you have our thanks for sharing dis with us. And we must return to Zul'Aman to investigate.",
["id"] = "s51_4252",
["timestamp"] = 1785259576,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: I can speed your return. Roots guide your path.",
["id"] = "s51_4253",
["timestamp"] = 1785259584,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Neonvoid! Help me search through Uncle's things while he communes with de loa.",
["id"] = "s51_4254",
["timestamp"] = 1785259710,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Akil'zon says dey know nothing of Ula'tek. Strange.",
["id"] = "s51_4255",
["timestamp"] = 1785259713,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Numazon? Yes! Those tablets are ancient and worth searching for clues.",
["id"] = "s51_4256",
["timestamp"] = 1785259719,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Because de Amani alone earned de victory.",
["id"] = "s51_4257",
["timestamp"] = 1785259720,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: See! De Amani stood alone. No loa! No gokinye!",
["id"] = "s51_4258",
["timestamp"] = 1785259728,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: And how many Amani died dat day, Jan-boy?",
["id"] = "s51_4259",
["timestamp"] = 1785259737,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask says: Get away! Leave me alone!",
["id"] = "s51_4260",
["timestamp"] = 1785259740,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: A spirit mask! Grab it!",
["id"] = "s51_4261",
["timestamp"] = 1785259744,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: I never owned a mask like that. Where did it come from? Bring it here, Neonvoid.",
["id"] = "s51_4262",
["timestamp"] = 1785259747,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask says: Who are you? Don't hurt me!",
["id"] = "s51_4263",
["timestamp"] = 1785259754,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: You are damaged, friend! Neonvoid, grab my tools and some supplies.",
["id"] = "s51_4264",
["timestamp"] = 1785259758,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask says: Dey attacked de city. Dey tried to destroy me!",
["id"] = "s51_4265",
["timestamp"] = 1785259762,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Who did?",
["id"] = "s51_4266",
["timestamp"] = 1785259768,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask says: My... my memory is foggy...",
["id"] = "s51_4267",
["timestamp"] = 1785259770,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: De haranir lied. There is no mention of Ula'tek.",
["id"] = "s51_4268",
["timestamp"] = 1785259775,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask says: Ula'tek? De ultimate weapon of de Amani?",
["id"] = "s51_4269",
["timestamp"] = 1785259781,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: What do you mean a weapon? What do you know?",
["id"] = "s51_4270",
["timestamp"] = 1785259781,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Numazon is our only lead about Ula'tek. At least until dis mask remembers more.",
["id"] = "s51_4271",
["timestamp"] = 1785259787,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Do you know who you are? Tell me what you remember.",
["id"] = "s51_4272",
["timestamp"] = 1785259796,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask says: I will try--it's fragments. You... you seem familiar though...",
["id"] = "s51_4273",
["timestamp"] = 1785259801,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: Gnarldin be attacking our hunting parties, stealing from us. Hit dem back and retrieve what ya can.",
["id"] = "s51_4274",
["timestamp"] = 1785259821,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: We are searching for knowledge, Jan-boy. Not weapons.",
["id"] = "s51_4275",
["timestamp"] = 1785259834,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra yells: My warriors! Dese creatures want de energies of Speaker's Rest! We must not let dem take it!",
["id"] = "s51_4276",
["timestamp"] = 1785259838,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: If Ula'tek is our weapon, we would be fools not to reclaim it.",
["id"] = "s51_4277",
["timestamp"] = 1785259839,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Can de Vilebranch hex sticks restore de mask's memory?",
["id"] = "s51_4278",
["timestamp"] = 1785259842,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
