},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|T134332:12|t|Hitem:262654::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Amani Tablet Rubbing]|h|r",
["id"] = "s51_4322",
["timestamp"] = 1785260459,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vilebranch Hexwarder",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vilebranch Hexwarder says: Shadows are talking strange in my ear...",
["id"] = "s51_4323",
["timestamp"] = 1785260460,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Dis tablet here says de first shrine built in Atal'Aman was dedicated to de serpent's victory.",
["id"] = "s51_4324",
["timestamp"] = 1785260480,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Befuddled Amani Mask says: De path to Ula'tek lies in de Maisara Deeps. With Hex Lord Malacrass.",
["id"] = "s51_4325",
["timestamp"] = 1785260485,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Vilebranch? Malacrass? We must tell Zul'jarra.",
["id"] = "s51_4326",
["timestamp"] = 1785260488,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Are dey talking about Ula'tek?",
["id"] = "s51_4327",
["timestamp"] = 1785260488,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: She will try to stop me from finding Ula'tek, just like with de lightwood. But we needed de lightwood, and we will need Ula'tek.",
["id"] = "s51_4328",
["timestamp"] = 1785260493,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: If de ancient Amani sealed Ula'tek away, it may be too dangerous to unleash.",
["id"] = "s51_4329",
["timestamp"] = 1785260504,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Or it may be de weapon we need. For when de elves make war on us. For when de loa abandon us.",
["id"] = "s51_4330",
["timestamp"] = 1785260509,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: De loa will not abandon us!",
["id"] = "s51_4331",
["timestamp"] = 1785260518,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: How can you be sure? They have done it before, ah? Why not put some of that faith in me, Uncle?",
["id"] = "s51_4332",
["timestamp"] = 1785260521,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: De Ethereals want to steal life from our lands? Hunt dem down and break their machines.",
["id"] = "s51_4333",
["timestamp"] = 1785260575,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Hal'hadar Architect",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Hal'hadar Architect says: You're too late to stop us!",
["id"] = "s51_4334",
["timestamp"] = 1785260596,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Hal'hadar Architect",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Hal'hadar Architect says: You dare intrude on our operations?",
["id"] = "s51_4335",
["timestamp"] = 1785260598,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Xal'atath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.9215686917304993,
["g"] = 0.7098039388656616,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Xal'atath whispers: Did you feel it cease to exist?",
["id"] = "s51_4336",
["timestamp"] = 1785260609,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Hal'hadar Architect",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Hal'hadar Architect says: We are... many...",
["id"] = "s51_4337",
["timestamp"] = 1785260610,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Hal'hadar Arcanografter",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Hal'hadar Arcanografter says: You squander the power beneath this land!",
["id"] = "s51_4338",
["timestamp"] = 1785260612,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Hal'hadar Arcanografter",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Hal'hadar Arcanografter says: All this work...agh... wasted...",
["id"] = "s51_4339",
["timestamp"] = 1785260623,
},
