["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "Vollzgrimm-Sargeras receives loot: |cnIQ3:|T7278019:12|t|Hitem:251166::::::::90:258::17:3:13441:13436:13578:2:9:86:28:3022:::::|h[Falconer's Cinch (Waist 171)]|h|r.",
["id"] = "s51_4528",
["timestamp"] = 1785268065,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Neonvoid. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?",
["id"] = "s51_4529",
["timestamp"] = 1785268067,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONEY",
["type"] = "MONEY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = -0,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "You loot 17 Gold, 65 Silver, 96 Copper",
["id"] = "s51_4530",
["timestamp"] = 1785268067,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.",
["id"] = "s51_4531",
["timestamp"] = 1785268074,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rokh'zal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!",
["id"] = "s51_4532",
["timestamp"] = 1785268088,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.",
["id"] = "s51_4533",
["timestamp"] = 1785268088,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: Using the souls of de dead in powerful magic spells... I hope this is not why they brought my kin here.",
["id"] = "s51_4534",
["timestamp"] = 1785268096,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: It be worse than we thought. How many of my people have died here?",
["id"] = "s51_4535",
["timestamp"] = 1785268188,
},
