},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Strongblood Jak'mo yells: Death to all who seek de serpent's power!",
["id"] = "s51_4581",
["timestamp"] = 1785268882,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Stop! We don't need to do this!",
["id"] = "s51_4582",
["timestamp"] = 1785268894,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Yes we do, uncle! De Amani must stand strong! We carve our own path!",
["id"] = "s51_4583",
["timestamp"] = 1785268898,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Do not be tempted by power like your grandfather! He brought ruin to us all!",
["id"] = "s51_4584",
["timestamp"] = 1785268909,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: He tried to unite de tribes! To take back de land dat was stolen from us!",
["id"] = "s51_4585",
["timestamp"] = 1785268917,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: You do not need Ula'tek's power, Jan-boy! We have Zul'jarra, de hash'ey, to protect us!",
["id"] = "s51_4586",
["timestamp"] = 1785268921,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: And when de loa abandon us again? We cannot rely on dem!",
["id"] = "s51_4587",
["timestamp"] = 1785268928,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Strongblood Jak'mo",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Strongblood Jak'mo says: I promised de Amani... Never again...",
["id"] = "s51_4588",
["timestamp"] = 1785268955,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Our ancestors are warning us! Neonvoid, help me stop this!",
["id"] = "s51_4589",
["timestamp"] = 1785268960,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: De Twilight's Blade think dey can sneak into our homes. We may be weakened, but we are not weak. Find dem.",
["id"] = "s51_4590",
["timestamp"] = 1785268967,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: You're awake! You were out for quite a while.",
["id"] = "s51_4591",
["timestamp"] = 1785268972,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Zul'jarra is at the loa shrine attending to Kinduru. Come.",
["id"] = "s51_4592",
["timestamp"] = 1785268982,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: What will we do without you, Uncle?",
["id"] = "s51_4593",
["timestamp"] = 1785268989,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: I see. Neonvoid, would you honor us by helping with de death rites? De herbs are on de cart.",
["id"] = "s51_4594",
["timestamp"] = 1785268991,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: As for Zul'jan, he has always obsessed over our ancestors' legacy. And our grandfather's glory.",
["id"] = "s51_4595",
["timestamp"] = 1785268999,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: But to join forces with Malacrass? Dat fool! I warned him about dat villain. He manipulated Grandfather, and now...",
["id"] = "s51_4596",
["timestamp"] = 1785269009,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = -0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ3:|T7210231:12|t|Hitem:268557::::::::90:258::11::1:28:373:::::|h[Akiki]|h|r",
["id"] = "s51_4597",
["timestamp"] = 1785269017,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Zul'jarra, I bear responsibility for putting your brother on this path. I will help you find him.",
["id"] = "s51_4598",
["timestamp"] = 1785269017,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Malacrass did this. He killed my uncle. I know it in my bones. And now he has my brother in his clutches.",
["id"] = "s51_4599",
["timestamp"] = 1785269019,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Uncle, I'm sorry I wasn't there to protect you. I should not have made Zul'jan your responsibility.",
["timestamp"] = 1785280546,
["id"] = "s51_4600",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: He's always trouble. Remember our trip to de coast? Little Zul'jan tried to swim across de strait! You were so mad!",
["timestamp"] = 1785280554,
["id"] = "s51_4601",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: When our father died, you helped our mother raise us. Told us stories of de loa, taught us what it means to be Amani.",
["timestamp"] = 1785280565,
["id"] = "s51_4602",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Then when de Twilight's Blade nearly beat us, you were de one to put me on de path of de hash'ey.",
["timestamp"] = 1785280575,
["id"] = "s51_4603",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: You are de reason why de loa came back to us. You never lost faith in dem. And you never lost faith in me.",
["timestamp"] = 1785280581,
["id"] = "s51_4604",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: You were a second father to me, Uncle Kinduru. I will miss you. And I hope dat I have made you proud.",
["timestamp"] = 1785280590,
["id"] = "s51_4605",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: De Twilight's Blade think dey can sneak into our homes. We may be weakened, but we are not weak. Find dem.",
["timestamp"] = 1785280702,
["id"] = "s51_4606",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rannan Korren",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Rannan Korren says: The healing properties we discovered deserve additional experimentation! Gather them up, and we'll see what we can do.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281388,
["id"] = "s51_4607",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Shore up our flanks! I don't want any surprises from the Sundered Flame.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281438,
["id"] = "s51_4608",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: Sabellian, something dark saps my strength within these halls. Can you feel it?",
["timestamp"] = 1785281443,
["id"] = "s51_4609",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: I do. It is nearly overwhelming. Thankfully, our champions seem unaffected.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281448,
["id"] = "s51_4610",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: All the more reason to stop Sarkareth now. He must not be allowed to claim whatever power still lurks here.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281456,
["id"] = "s51_4611",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: We have you pinned, Sarkareth! End this madness before more of your soldiers die.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281463,
["id"] = "s51_4612",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: We would rather die than return to subjugation.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281469,
["id"] = "s51_4613",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: The secrets within this crucible are ours to claim! With their power, we will never serve again!",
["timestamp"] = 1785281473,
["id"] = "s51_4614",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Winglord Dezran",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Winglord Dezran says: Our lines are breaking, Sarkareth! We cannot hold them!",
["timestamp"] = 1785281483,
["id"] = "s51_4615",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: Permission to suggest an alternate tactic?",
["timestamp"] = 1785281487,
["id"] = "s51_4616",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: During my time serving Neltharion, I assisted him in creating many... powerful elements.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281490,
["id"] = "s51_4617",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: One of these instruments could be of great service to you... though it may not distinguish between friend and foe.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281497,
["id"] = "s51_4618",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: What is this power?",
["timestamp"] = 1785281507,
["id"] = "s51_4619",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: In the quest to perfect Neltharion's armor, we went through many iterations.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281509,
["id"] = "s51_4620",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: This is one of our more successful attempts. While imperfect, it will be more than enough to destroy these interlopers.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281514,
["id"] = "s51_4621",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONEY",
["type"] = "MONEY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "You loot 14 Gold, 52 Silver, 83 Copper",
["timestamp"] = 1785281516,
["id"] = "s51_4622",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: Do it!",
["timestamp"] = 1785281522,
["id"] = "s51_4623",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Winglord Dezran",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Winglord Dezran says: But our troops are still out there!",
["timestamp"] = 1785281523,
["id"] = "s51_4624",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: Their names will ever be remembered.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281525,
["id"] = "s51_4625",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "Orc",
["name"] = "Steeww",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Steeww-Tichondrius:48:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddSteeww|r]|h: anyone have a toon they want to lvl im tanking timewal;k dungeons on my DK",
["timestamp"] = 1785281675,
["id"] = "s51_4626",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["race"] = "VoidElf",
["name"] = "Neonvoid",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
