["timestamp"] = 1785281752,
["id"] = "s51_4636",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: Finally, its grip weakens.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281758,
["id"] = "s51_4637",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Does Sarkareth wield some power that can tear at our minds?",
["timestamp"] = 1785281761,
["id"] = "s51_4638",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: The betrayer holds no such power, my son. Sinister forces are awakening... they sense your presence.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281765,
["id"] = "s51_4639",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Father?",
["timestamp"] = 1785281774,
["id"] = "s51_4640",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: I am but an echo. I cannot stop intruders from attempting to plunder my secrets.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281776,
["id"] = "s51_4641",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: Now that my heirs have arrived, we can ensure no outsider claims what is rightfully yours.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281783,
["id"] = "s51_4642",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: I assume you have heard many stories of this place, and the role it played in my downfall.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281791,
["id"] = "s51_4643",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: Do not let them temper your perception.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281799,
["id"] = "s51_4644",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: These halls are your birthright, and the outsiders must not be allowed to take them from you.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281802,
["id"] = "s51_4645",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Secure our perimeter!",
["timestamp"] = 1785281809,
["id"] = "s51_4646",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Wrathion, I will take a contingent down these halls and root out Sarkareth. You take the other path and see what you can find.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281811,
["id"] = "s51_4647",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: A wise plan. I shall accompany both of you and lend what aid I can.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281818,
["id"] = "s51_4648",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: Sabellian, as my blood I look to you to inherit. But know there are many who would steal your birthright.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281824,
["id"] = "s51_4649",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: Even now, djaradin forces use the chaos to launch an assault. They must be stopped.",
["timestamp"] = 1785281836,
["id"] = "s51_4650",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
