{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Their ranks are broken! We have won!",
["id"] = "s51_4674",
["timestamp"] = 1785282501,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: A fine victory, my son. I expected nothing less.",
["id"] = "s51_4675",
["timestamp"] = 1785282504,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: Yet, the crucible is not yet secure. There is one last obstacle that stands in your path.",
["id"] = "s51_4676",
["timestamp"] = 1785282509,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Name it, and I will see it removed.",
["id"] = "s51_4677",
["timestamp"] = 1785282516,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rashok",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Rashok says: I will be free!",
["id"] = "s51_4678",
["timestamp"] = 1785282598,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: How did this elder get past our lines?",
["id"] = "s51_4679",
["timestamp"] = 1785282603,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: This beast was not in the attack. It was what they were hoping to free.",
["id"] = "s51_4680",
["timestamp"] = 1785282605,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: It served as effective fuel for the crucible for millennia.",
["id"] = "s51_4681",
["timestamp"] = 1785282610,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rashok",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Rashok yells: A millennia of torment ends. Destruction begins!",
["id"] = "s51_4682",
["timestamp"] = 1785282614,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: You were draining this djaradin for your experiments?",
["id"] = "s51_4683",
["timestamp"] = 1785282615,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Neltharion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Neltharion says: Such a pity. Now we must dispose of it before the conduits overload and destroy us all.",
["id"] = "s51_4684",
["timestamp"] = 1785282619,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Neonvoid-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rashok",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Rashok yells: Sear flesh.",
["id"] = "s51_4685",
["timestamp"] = 1785282738,
},
