:0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|T7639525:12|t|Hcurrency:3342:0|h[Veteran Dawncrest]|h|rx20\",\"id\":\"s42_3940\",\"timestamp\":1775575753},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx100\",\"id\":\"s42_3941\",\"timestamp\":1775575753},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Jeninn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jeninn-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dJeninn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:14738:Player-11-0E9F6FDE:1:4:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Hunting Party]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s42_3942\",\"timestamp\":1775575976},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Kitrix-Warsong\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Kitrix-Warsong:194:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Kitrix|r]|h: man my cat unplugged my 50 foot ethernet cable this guy's an asshole haha\",\"id\":\"s42_3943\",\"timestamp\":1775576161},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Kitrix-Warsong\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Kitrix-Warsong:195:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Kitrix|r]|h: he woke up and chose violence today what a dillweed\",\"id\":\"s42_3944\",\"timestamp\":1775576172},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Arisol-Blackrock\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Arisol-Blackrock:217:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddArisol|r]|h: If all he did was unplug it, then that would be an act of kindness based on typical cat standards, haha.\",\"id\":\"s42_3945\",\"timestamp\":1775576324},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Søvêreign-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Søvêreign-Tichondrius:236:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Søvêreign|r]|h: how do i start war within quest?\",\"id\":\"s42_3946\",\"timestamp\":1775576430},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Elves of Azeroth! The Devouring Host has come to consume our homes, our lives, and our families.\",\"id\":\"s42_3947\",\"timestamp\":1775576508},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: We will not let them take anyone else! Not one more. Today, we break the Void!\",\"id\":\"s42_3948\",\"timestamp\":1775576518},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: The Twilight's Blade have seized the docks. We must deal with them first before we assault the span.\",\"id\":\"s42_3949\",\"timestamp\":1775576532},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Vereesa will provide support from the skies and Thalyssra from the sea.\",\"id\":\"s42_3950\",\"timestamp\":1775576534},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: The rest of us will pierce the enemy's line and secure the harbor. Stormclout, with me!\",\"id\":\"s42_3951\",\"timestamp\":1775576540},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Champion! Our troops are ready to assist. Signal them when needed.\",\"id\":\"s42_3952\",\"timestamp\":1775576547},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Stormclout just won a game of Hearthstone!\",\"id\":\"s42_3953\",\"timestamp\":1775576554},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T133728:12|t|Hitem:260642::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Fossilized Wildlife]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s42_3954\",\"timestamp\":1775576567},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T7137505:12|t|Hitem:260659::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s42_3955\",\"timestamp\":1775576567},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 51 Silver, 8 Copper\",\"id\":\"s42_3956\",\"timestamp\":1775576568},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron yells: Silvermoon will not fall to the likes of you!\",\"id\":\"s42_3957\",\"timestamp\":1775576569},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Voidcaller\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Twilight Voidcaller says: She has... what she needs...\",\"id\":\"s42_3958\",\"timestamp\":1775576621},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Duskwarden\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Twilight Duskwarden says: The Sunwell is hers!\",\"id\":\"s42_3959\",\"timestamp\":1775576636},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Voidcaller\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Twilight Voidcaller says: No... Xal'atath...\",\"id\":\"s42_3960\",\"timestamp\":1775576637},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Duskwarden\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Twilight Duskwarden says: No... Xal'atath...\",\"id\":\"s42_3961\",\"timestamp\":1775576652},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Voidcaller\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Twilight Voidcaller says: The Sunwell is hers!\",\"id\":\"s42_3962\",\"timestamp\":1775576676},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra says: Our ships are blockaded! We cannot launch an assault on the bridge!\",\"id\":\"s42_3963\",\"timestamp\":1775576697},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Then we need to secure the docks! Stormclout, push forward!\",\"id\":\"s42_3964\",\"timestamp\":1775576703},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T7137505:12|t|Hitem:260659::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s42_3965\",\"timestamp\":1775576709},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T514019:12|t|Hitem:260661::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Glowing Shrub]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s42_3966\",\"timestamp\":1775576709},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 8 Gold, 97 Silver, 29 Copper\",\"id\":\"s42_3967\",\"timestamp\":1775576710},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Where are we going today, Grandmaster?\",\"id\":\"s42_3968\",\"timestamp\":1775576723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon yells: Suffer the wrath of the kaldorei!\",\"id\":\"s42_3969\",\"timestamp\":1775576724},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin yells: Light grant me strength!\",\"id\":\"s42_3970\",\"timestamp\":1775576732},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Have I told you the tale of the hozen and the buttercream pie? Hmm... Perhaps best saved for another time.\",\"id\":\"s42_3971\",\"timestamp\":1775576734},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra yells: It seems time is on our side!\",\"id\":\"s42_3972\",\"timestamp\":1775576740},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Farewell!\",\"id\":\"s42_3973\",\"timestamp\":1775576748},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Stormclout just won a game of Hearthstone!\",\"id\":\"s42_3974\",\"timestamp\":1775576751},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bleck the Voidspitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Bleck the Voidspitter says: Your ships... won't stop us...\",\"id\":\"s42_3975\",\"timestamp\":1775576758},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Udor Eyestabber\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Udor Eyestabber says: Nocturnius is... invincible...\",\"id\":\"s42_3976\",\"timestamp\":1775576768},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: My cavalry can't provide air support! The ethereals will shoot us out of the sky!\",\"id\":\"s42_3977\",\"timestamp\":1775576768},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T7137505:12|t|Hitem:260659::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s42_3978\",\"timestamp\":1775576769},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 18 Gold, 10 Silver, 93 Copper\",\"id\":\"s42_3979\",\"timestamp\":1775576770},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Stormclout! Find and mark their cannons so the ren'dorei can destroy them!\",\"id\":\"s42_3980\",\"timestamp\":1775576774},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shadowguard Warpblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shadowguard Warpblade says: This world is ours!\",\"id\":\"s42_3981\",\"timestamp\":1775576806},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 8 Gold, 98 Silver, 75 Copper\",\"id\":\"s42_3982\",\"timestamp\":1775576824},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric yells: The Void obeys my will!\",\"id\":\"s42_3983\",\"timestamp\":1775576831},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shadowguard Nethermage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shadowguard Nethermage says: An end... at last...\",\"id\":\"s42_3984\",\"timestamp\":1775576835},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: That's the last cannon! Signal Vereesa to strike!\",\"id\":\"s42_3985\",\"timestamp\":1775576854},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Champion! Now that the skies are clear, fly to me at the bridge. It is time to advance to Quel'Danas!\",\"id\":\"s42_3986\",\"timestamp\":1775576882},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Thalyssra and Vereesa are in position.\",\"id\":\"s42_3987\",\"timestamp\":1775576896},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Now is the time! Signal Thalyssra to open fire!\",\"id\":\"s42_3988\",\"timestamp\":1775576899},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: ATTACK!\",\"id\":\"s42_3989\",\"timestamp\":1775576906},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Stormclout just won a game of Hearthstone!\",\"id\":\"s42_3990\",\"timestamp\":1775576916},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Stormlad-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stormlad-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddStormlad|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42768:Player-11-0EB30C20:1:4:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Champion of the Dawn]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s42_3991\",\"timestamp\":1775576921},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: The enemy's lines are breaking! Do not let up!\",\"id\":\"s42_3992\",\"timestamp\":1775576925},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: We have them on the run! Let this Devouring Host know the fury of Quel'Thalas!\",\"id\":\"s42_3993\",\"timestamp\":1775576929},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath says: Young little Arator. So much like your parents. Leading an army to their meaningless death.\",\"id\":\"s42_3994\",\"timestamp\":1775576952},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: This army will see you vanquished, Xal'atath. I swear it on my father's shield.\",\"id\":\"s42_3995\",\"timestamp\":1775576963},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath says: Will your Light twist into wrath? Will you set your armor ablaze again? And this time, will your friends burn in the flames?\",\"id\":\"s42_3996\",\"timestamp\":1775576976},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T7137505:12|t|Hitem:260659::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx7\",\"id\":\"s42_3997\",\"timestamp\":1775576977},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T7137505:12|t|Hitem:260659::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s42_3998\",\"timestamp\":1775576977},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T237286:12|t|Hitem:260638::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Fine Void Residue]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s42_3999\",\"timestamp\":1775576977},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 10 Silver, 72 Copper\",\"id\":\"s42_4000\",\"timestamp\":1775576978},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: The only one who will burn today is you.\",\"id\":\"s42_4001\",\"timestamp\":1775576988},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath says: I offer you a way out, Arator. A chance to leave and lick your wounds. After all, I never took any interest in you.\",\"id\":\"s42_4002\",\"timestamp\":1775576999},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Is that fear in your voice, Xal'atath? We aren't going anywhere.\",\"id\":\"s42_4003\",\"timestamp\":1775577013},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin is reviving you!\",\"id\":\"s42_4004\",\"timestamp\":1775577021},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra says: Bring down that shield! Fire!\",\"id\":\"s42_4005\",\"timestamp\":1775577027},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Advance! Give these voidspawn no quarter!\",\"id\":\"s42_4006\",\"timestamp\":1775577036},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Stormclout just won a game of Hearthstone!\",\"id\":\"s42_4007\",\"timestamp\":1775577043},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Elves of Azeroth! With me! One final push to the Sunwell!\",\"id\":\"s42_4008\",\"timestamp\":1775577063},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 79 Silver, 61 Copper\",\"id\":\"s42_4009\",\"timestamp\":1775577063},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Taking the span was just the first step. Now we must face Xal'atath before this Darkwell corrupts all of Azeroth.\",\"id\":\"s42_4010\",\"timestamp\":1775577084},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T6703755:12|t|Hitem:258122::::::::90:269::11::1:28:373:::::|h[Emerald Hatchling]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s42_4011\",\"timestamp\":1775577087},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7454938:12|t|Hitem:260233::::::::90:269::11::1:28:872:::::|h[Emerald Hawkstrider]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s42_4012\",\"timestamp\":1775577087},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T7639517:12|t|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s42_4013\",\"timestamp\":1775577088},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: We've made it across the bridge, but the true battle lies ahead. Be ready for the worst, Stormclout.\",\"id\":\"s42_4014\",\"timestamp\":1775577090},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Good to see you again, Grandmaster.\",\"id\":\"s42_4015\",\"timestamp\":1775577144},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Good luck, Grandmaster!\",\"id\":\"s42_4016\",\"timestamp\":1775577159},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Uuna begins singing.\",\"id\":\"s42_4017\",\"timestamp\":1775577582},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event