0406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: The Void... mother says it speaks to you. To Belo'ren, we are attacking what he was sworn to defend.\",\"id\":\"s44_2808\",\"timestamp\":1775703743},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin yells: Keep going, you two! We will hold them off--get to the Sunwell!\",\"id\":\"s44_2809\",\"timestamp\":1775703748},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Smileclap|h[Smileclap]: |h|A:ping_chat_threat:0:0:0:0|aThreatening alert: Tenebrous Striker\",\"id\":\"s44_2810\",\"timestamp\":1775703752},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Nightborne\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Faesure-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Faesure-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Faesure|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:18872:Player-11-0E5BE55D:1:4:8:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Dangerous Devices I]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s44_2811\",\"timestamp\":1775703765},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Smileclap|h[Smileclap]: |h|A:ping_chat_threat:0:0:0:0|aThreatening alert: Void Egg\",\"id\":\"s44_2812\",\"timestamp\":1775703779},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hpl