9:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Brutally Dedicated]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1775750377,\"id\":\"s44_3150\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Silvermoon's students have unique ways of studying the arcane. Perhaps you could learn a thing or two.\",\"timestamp\":1775750682,\"id\":\"s44_3151\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"As you step inside, drawn ever closer to hidden treasure, your Coffer Key Shards stir as if awakened by the promise of riches. They shimmer, then fuse together, becoming whole once more.\",\"timestamp\":1775750833,\"id\":\"s44_3152\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|T4622270:12|t|Hcurrency:3028:0|h[Restored Coffer Key]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1775750834,\"id\":\"s44_3153\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar begins making a campfire.\",\"timestamp\":1775750836,\"id\":\"s44_3154\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"University Undergraduate\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"University Undergraduate says: Something is not right? You were speaking with those monsters!\",\"timestamp\":1775750878,\"id\":\"s44_3155\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Gather yourself.\",\"timestamp\":1775750882,\"id\":\"s44_3156\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Your life is mine.\",\"timestamp\":1775750882,\"id\":\"s44_3157\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: I'll savor this strike.\",\"timestamp\":1775750885,\"id\":\"s44_3158\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Don't waste this.\",\"timestamp\":1775750892,\"id\":\"s44_3159\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Stay here and recover.\",\"timestamp\":1775750897,\"id\":\"s44_3160\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Now strike!\",\"timestamp\":1775750899,\"id\":\"s44_3161\"},{\"recordedBy\