Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: We must make haste. Xal'atath is using Alleria's rage and pain to erode her mastery over the Void.\",\"id\":\"s46_3055\",\"timestamp\":1776307545},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: After what happened with Turalyon and Arator... I can see how Alleria would struggle to maintain control. I doubt I'd be able to, if it were me.\",\"id\":\"s46_3056\",\"timestamp\":1776307555},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: Mother!\",\"id\":\"s46_3057\",\"timestamp\":1776307566},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon yells: Alleria!\",\"id\":\"s46_3058\",\"timestamp\":1776307567},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: How touching. Your family has come to say goodbye.\",\"id\":\"s46_3059\",\"timestamp\":1776307569},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Ah, and my favorite champions as well! I was afraid you might miss this.\",\"id\":\"s46_3060\",\"timestamp\":1776307575},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner grimaces in pain.\",\"id\":\"s46_3061\",\"timestamp\":1776307584},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: What are you doing to her?!\",\"id\":\"s46_3062\",\"timestamp\":1776307585},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Keeping my promise, of course. Taking everything she loves. Leaving her with nothing but the Void.\",\"id\":\"s46_3063\",\"timestamp\":1776307586},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Ceevipw-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ceevipw-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Ceevipw|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62143:Player-11-0E604D54:1:4:15:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Trapped In The Middle With You]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s46_3064\",\"timestamp\":1776307622},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Notmagicz-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":