 yours, Stormclout: to discover the secret behind this fungarian spear. I look forward to what you uncover.\",\"id\":\"s47_2974\",\"timestamp\":1776880232},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s47_2975\",\"timestamp\":1776880252},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Fungarian tenacity meets rutaani thorns, and all of Harandar bleeds. We haranir step in, not to win a war, but to prune it before the rot consumes all.\",\"id\":\"s47_2976\",\"timestamp\":1776880266},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Stormclout just won a game of Hearthstone!\",\"id\":\"s47_2977\",\"timestamp\":1776880278},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Fungarian Brawler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Fungarian Brawler says: My cap broken... Russula will avenge...\",\"id\":\"s47_2978\",\"timestamp\":1776880279},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rutaani Skirmisher\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rutaani Skirmisher says: We will grow back!\",\"id\":\"s47_2979\",\"timestamp\":1776880283},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Fungarian Brawler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Fungarian Brawler says: Russula will snap you twigs!\",\"id\":\"s47_2980\",\"timestamp\":1776880285},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rutaani Skirmisher\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rutaani Skirmisher says: Fungal rot... must be cleansed...\",\"id\":\"s47_2981\",\"timestamp\":1776880286},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|T1500968:12|t|Hitem:265800::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Earthy Garnish]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s47_2982\",\"timestamp\":1776880286},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 90 Silver, 45 Copper\",\"id\":\"s47_2983\",\"timestamp\":1776880287},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The first skirmish is halted, yet anger still simmers. The leaders of both sides refuse to reason except for one.\",\"id\":\"s47_2984\",\"timestamp\":1776880293},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Roonek\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Roonek says: This one hears... but the petals have fallen. Only thorns remain.\",\"id\":\"s47_2985\",\"timestamp\":1776880300},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Pustulehelm\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Pustulehelm says: Boring! No deal! They snap stalks, we snap back harder! Tell rutaani no cry when spores fly next!\",\"id\":\"s47_2986\",\"timestamp\":1776880312},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Russula\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Russula yells: You! Fighter with brain! Come quick, want peace words!\",\"id\":\"s47_2987\",\"timestamp\":1776880313},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Behold Russula, an advocate for mercy whose plea was drowned by the drums of war. But Russula knew how to make their voice heard over the din.\",\"id\":\"s47_2988\",\"timestamp\":1776880321},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Grown to a size that none could ignore, the fungarian used their might to put an end to the battle. Their actions were to separate the combatants, not break them.\",\"id\":\"s47_2989\",\"timestamp\":1776880363},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Rutaani\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Rutaani says: This one bleeds... but from pride. It is shorn.\",\"id\":\"s47_2990\",\"timestamp\":1776880369},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Fungarian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Fungarian says: I not lose, just... resting.\",\"id\":\"s47_2991\",\"timestamp\":1776880371},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Fungarian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Fungarian says: Stop! You bash sense in us. Big ouch, bigger lesson!\",\"id\":\"s47_2992\",\"timestamp\":1776880373},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Rutaani\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Rutaani says: This one's petals... tremble. Roots unsure.\",\"id\":\"s47_2993\",\"timestamp\":1776880374},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Rutaani\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Rutaani says: Thorns bent. No more cutting. Enough said.\",\"id\":\"s47_2994\",\"timestamp\":1776880379},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Rutaani\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Rutaani says: This one bleeds... but from pride. It is shorn.\",\"id\":\"s47_2995\",\"timestamp\":1776880381},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Fungarian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Fungarian says: Stop! You bash sense in us. Big ouch, bigger lesson!\",\"id\":\"s47_2996\",\"timestamp\":1776880386},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warbound Fungarian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Warbound Fungarian says: Okay, okay! Peace talk! No more bonks!\",\"id\":\"s47_2997\",\"timestamp\":1776880389},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: With the fighting ended, they lay down their spear and asked the haranir to stop the killing. This is Russula's lesson: strength can bring victory, but tempered with mercy, it brings a greater victory.\",\"id\":\"s47_2998\",\"timestamp\":1776880390},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s47_2999\",\"timestamp\":1776880399},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T7491956:12|t|Hitem:262906::::::::90:269::11::1:28:3321:::::|h[Harandar Anvil]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s47_3000\",\"timestamp\":1776880417},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T348526:12|t|Hitem:263467::::::::90:269::11::2:9:90:28:3321:::::|h[Avid Learner's Supply Pack]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s47_3001\",\"timestamp\":1776880417},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: May Russula's Outreach remind us to temper our claws. Harandar endures longest when mercy guides the hunt.\",\"id\":\"s47_3002\",\"timestamp\":1776880417},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7232471:12|t|Hitem:256983::::::::90:269::29:3:12777:6652:13577:1:28:3321:::::|h[Verdant Tracker's Vest (Chest 233)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s47_3003\",\"timestamp\":1776880420},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|T7639525:12|t|Hcurrency:3342:0|h[Veteran Dawncrest]|h|rx20\",\"id\":\"s47_3004\",\"timestamp\":1776880421},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx100\",\"id\":\"s47_3005\",\"timestamp\":1776880421},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T1708500:12|t|Hitem:26431