found our... your target, Riftblade. Why do you insist on waiting?\",\"id\":\"s50_4079\",\"timestamp\":1781650575},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: We are not charging in through another portal blind, Decimus. We need a few experts before we mobilize, starting with our champion here.\",\"id\":\"s50_4080\",\"timestamp\":1781650585},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: I appreciate your discretion in this matter, hero. Come, let us speak privately.\",\"id\":\"s50_4081\",\"timestamp\":1781650596},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: The Grand Magister awaits us in the Terrace. Hopefully our welcome is warmer than our last visit.\",\"id\":\"s50_4082\",\"timestamp\":1781650600},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Behold, the Sunstrider Omnium...\",\"id\":\"s50_4083\",\"timestamp\":1781650645},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Silent and dormant since the fall of King Anasterian. Until now...\",\"id\":\"s50_4084\",\"timestamp\":1781650648},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Omnial d-d-damage detected. M-m-mirror Echo Imprint--Failure imminent.\",\"id\":\"s50_4085\",\"timestamp\":1781650663},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Dar'Khan Drathir\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Dar'Khan Drathir says: I will not be denied the knowledge within any longer--the Void Magicule is mine!\",\"id\":\"s50_4086\",\"timestamp\":1781650668},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Tizziot-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tizziot-Proudmoore|h[|cffff7c0aTizziot-Proudmoore|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:515:Player-5-0EAA0FA8:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[500 Honorable Kills]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4087\",\"timestamp\":1781650683},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Tizziot-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_YELL\",\"type\":\"YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tizziot-Proudmoore:40:YELL:|h[|cffff7c0aTizziot-Proudmoore|r]|h yells: [Orcish] =NogU=\",\"id\":\"s50_4088\",\"timestamp\":1781650718},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Sunstrider Key-Cipher not recognized. Mirror Echo Imprint engaged.\",\"id\":\"s50_4089\",\"timestamp\":1781650718},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Hufflecraft-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hufflecraft-Illidan|h[|cff0070ddHufflecraft-Illidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62513:Player-57-0E26A04B:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Outstanding in the Field]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4090\",\"timestamp\":1781650721},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Kael'thas Sunstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Kael'thas Sunstrider says: Not recognized? I am a Sunstrider! The Omnium belongs to ME!\",\"id\":\"s50_4091\",\"timestamp\":1781650723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Dar'Khan Drathir\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Dar'Khan Drathir says: I will not be denied the knowledge within any longer--the Void Magicule is mine!\",\"id\":\"s50_4092\",\"timestamp\":1781650736},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Tizziot-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_YELL\",\"type\":\"YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tizziot-Proudmoore:45:YELL:|h[|cffff7c0aTizziot-Proudmoore|r]|h yells: [Orcish] =NogU=\",\"id\":\"s50_4093\",\"timestamp\":1781650750},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Sunstrider Key-Cipher not recognized. Mirror Echo Imprint engaged.\",\"id\":\"s50_4094\",\"timestamp\":1781650865},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx150\",\"id\":\"s50_4095\",\"timestamp\":1781650925},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4096\",\"timestamp\":1781650978},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Murky-Frostmane\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Murky-Frostmane|h[|cfffff468Murky-Frostmane|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:63240:Player-1168-0AF704B5:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Heroic: Rotmire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4097\",\"timestamp\":1781650986},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Murky-Frostmane\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Murky-Frostmane|h[|cfffff468Murky-Frostmane|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:63241:Player-1168-0AF704B5:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Mythic: Rotmire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4098\",\"timestamp\":1781650986},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Murky-Frostmane\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Murky-Frostmane|h[|cfffff468Murky-Frostmane|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:63237:Player-1168-0AF704B5:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Rotmire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4099\",\"timestamp\":1781650986},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4100\",\"timestamp\":1781651023},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx9\",\"id\":\"s50_4101\",\"timestamp\":1781651034},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Manyfaced plants the Flag of Ownership in the corpse of Calypsô.\",\"id\":\"s50_4102\",\"timestamp\":1781651035},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s50_4103\",\"timestamp\":1781651041},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Unauthorized Magister detected. Sunstrider security ward engaged.\",\"id\":\"s50_4104\",\"timestamp\":1781651052},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Grapestreet\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grapestreet plants the Flag of Ownership in the corpse of Tizziot.\",\"id\":\"s50_4105\",\"timestamp\":1781651061},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s50_4106\",\"timestamp\":1781651074},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s50_4107\",\"timestamp\":1781651097},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s50_4108\",\"timestamp\":1781651100},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s50_4109\",\"timestamp\":1781651171},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4110\",\"timestamp\":1781651188},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Whether it was arcane, fel, or even Light or... Void, Dath'Remar created the Omnium to preserve knowledge within.\",\"id\":\"s50_4111\",\"timestamp\":1781651194},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: But when King Anasterian fell, the Omnium shut down--not even Kael'thas knew how to revive it.\",\"id\":\"s50_4112\",\"timestamp\":1781651207},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Uuna begins singing.\",\"id\":\"s50_4113\",\"timestamp\":1781651208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Uuna:84:SAY:|h[Uuna]|h says: Tulip's sister, pure and humble! Seeks to... something...\",\"id\":\"s50_4114\",\"timestamp\":1781651208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Uuna mumbles.\",\"id\":\"s50_4115\",\"timestamp\":1781651208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s50_4116\",\"timestamp\":1781651217},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Manyfaced plants the Flag of Ownership in the corpse of Phatdotts.\",\"id\":\"s50_4117\",\"timestamp\":1781651221},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s50_4118\",\"timestamp\":1781651248},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Unauthorized Magister detected. Sunstrider security ward engaged.\",\"id\":\"s50_4119\",\"timestamp\":1781651265},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Dath'Remar Sunstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Dath'Remar Sunstrider says: The limitless pursuit of knowledge is not for the unworthy!\",\"id\":\"s50_4120\",\"timestamp\":1781651268},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: So why is it active now? And what's causing it to malfunction? Do you think Kael'thas--\",\"id\":\"s50_4121\",\"timestamp\":1781651293},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Damaged it? No. Apart from the stench of fel, the Omnium was still silent when found in his possessions.\",\"id\":\"s50_4122\",\"timestamp\":1781651302},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Kael'thas Sunstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Kael'thas Sunstrider says: Not recognized? I am a Sunstrider! The Omnium belongs to ME!\",\"id\":\"s50_4123\",\"timestamp\":1781651304},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Then if it was still dormant when you recovered it, could it somehow have been damaged before the King was slain?\",\"id\":\"s50_4124\",\"timestamp\":1781651317},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: The Omnium was well protected here in the Magisters' Terrace... until Silvermoon fell under attack.\",\"id\":\"s50_4125\",\"timestamp\":1781651326},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s50_4126\",\"timestamp\":1781651333},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: There was much carnage that day, Rommath. Perhaps these anomalies can tell us more.\",\"id\":\"s50_4127\",\"timestamp\":1781651333},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx150\",\"id\":\"s50_4128\",\"timestamp\":1781651336},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: If I can find the missing component Dar'Khan ripped from the Omnium, will you be able to recalibrate and stabilize it?\",\"id\":\"s50_4129\",\"timestamp\":1781651340},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: I will. Belo'vir should have locked the Grand Magister's key-cipher in his study... well, now my study.\",\"id\":\"s50_4130\",\"timestamp\":1781651349},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Crashcake-Quel'dorei\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Crashcake-Quel'dorei|h[|cffc41e3aCrashcake-Quel'dorei|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62606:Player-1185-08AC1E24:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Sunstrider Omnium]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4131\",\"timestamp\":1781651350},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: His safeguards will need to be unraveled. I will meet our champion there.\",\"id\":\"s50_4132\",\"timestamp\":1781651357},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: And I will search Dawnstar Spire to find the missing piece. Join me when you can, Manyfaced. And Rommath, good luck.\",\"id\":\"s50_4133\",\"timestamp\":1781651362},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Relying on mirror images to unlock multiple wards? Clever. Even in death, he is still teaching me...\",\"id\":\"s50_4134\",\"timestamp\":1781651428},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath conjures several mirror images before teleporting upstairs.\",\"id\":\"s50_4135\",\"timestamp\":1781651449},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar says: One final challenge yet remains, my apprentice.\",\"id\":\"s50_4136\",\"timestamp\":1781651518},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx150\",\"id\":\"s50_4137\",\"timestamp\":1781651592},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: I've managed to unravel most of his wards, but Belo'vir was always... extravagant with his safeguards. I will need your help for this last one.\",\"id\":\"s50_4138\",\"timestamp\":1781651596},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Manyfaced plants the Flag of Ownership in the corpse of Çpa.\",\"id\":\"s50_4139\",\"timestamp\":1781651603},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar says: One final challenge yet remains, my apprentice.\",\"id\":\"s50_4140\",\"timestamp\":1781651647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|T7549087:12|t|Hitem:274261::::::::90:260:::::::::|h[Grand Magister's Key-Cipher]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s50_4141\",\"timestamp\":1781651670},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"DarkIronDwarf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Stangin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stangin-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dStangin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62606:Player-11-0EB3EFF5:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Sunstrider Omnium]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4142\",\"timestamp\":1781651738},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T7639517:12|t|Hcurrency:3383:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4143\",\"timestamp\":1781651770},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T133016:12|t|Hcurrency:3310:0|h[Coffer Key Shards]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4144\",\"timestamp\":1781651771},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T7639517:12|t|Hcurrency:3383:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4145\",\"timestamp\":1781651779},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s50_4146\",\"timestamp\":1781651786},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4147\",\"timestamp\":1781651787},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx100\",\"id\":\"s50_4148\",\"timestamp\":1781651835},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: How many times must Dar'Khan's crimes haunt us? Be on your guard, champion. I sense... something.\",\"id\":\"s50_4149\",\"timestamp\":1781651836},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|T7554214:12|t|Hitem:274036::::::::90:260:::::::::|h[Void Magicule]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s50_4150\",\"timestamp\":1781651860},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T348555:12|t|Hitem:260669::::::::90:260:::::::::|h[Colorless Pebbles]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s50_4151\",\"timestamp\":1781651860},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Dar'Khan must've hidden this even from his master. I can't help but wonder what secrets he gleaned from it...\",\"id\":\"s50_4152\",\"timestamp\":1781651860},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx400\",\"id\":\"s50_4153\",\"timestamp\":1781651872},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Lanach-Lightbringer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lanach-Lightbringer|h[|cfff48cbaLanach-Lightbringer|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62606:Player-3694-071E6B02:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Sunstrider Omnium]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4154\",\"timestamp\":1781651920},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Manyfaced-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Manyfaced|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62606:Player-11-0EA380B9:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Sunstrider Omnium]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4155\",\"timestamp\":1781651943},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Manyfaced-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Manyfaced|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62606:Player-11-0EA380B9:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Sunstrider Omnium]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4156\",\"timestamp\":1781651943},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You re